 ResolveHandler←{
⍝ Resolve handler name to class reference
⍝ ⍵ = handler string in format "RepoName.ClassName"
⍝ Returns: class reference
     parts←('.'∘≠⊆⊢)⍵
     
⍝ Handler must be in format "RepoName.ClassName"
     2≠≢parts:⎕SIGNAL/('Handler format must be "RepoName.ClassName": ',⍵)11
     repo cls←parts
     nspath←'#.Handlers.',repo,'.',cls
     0=#.⎕NC nspath:⎕SIGNAL/('Handler class not found: ',nspath)11
     ⍎nspath
 }
